        "Title": "Give &apos;em the axe",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108032320941",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 83528e60-a4f3-4e79-b541-e6d43a180802).Image",
        "Description": "47. Our client, a hotel owner from Bangkok, has a problem with some loose-lipped staff selling customers secrets.  I have identified the 5 individuals involved, well I identified 1 and... convinced him to tell me about his friends.\r\rHe has vanished, permanently, you&apos;re welcome.  He recorded a little video for me first.  Infiltrate as hotel staff and give thes employees the axe... literally.  The clip will make its way to authorities and our vanished friend will take the blame.\r\rOff you pop.",
